{"id":"github:1152812782","source":"github","name":"photoo","summary":"photoo 是一款 Android 原生的极简照片整理工具。滑动卡片就能快速整理相册——左滑删除，右滑收藏，上滑保留。还有一系列\"该有的全都有\"的功能：相册分析生成专属摄影画像、沉浸式回顾喜爱照片、智能识别相似照片和低质量图片、视频和图片压缩......  但 photoo 不只是一个\"清理\"软件，它更是\"回忆\"。","icon":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52056870?v=4","stars":771,"homepage":"https://github.com/xigua222/photoo","updated":"2026-09-02T17:09:58Z","version":"","apk_url":"","categories":["android-app","gallery","kotlin","organizer"],"license":"NOASSERTION","language":"Kotlin","detail_url":"data/detail/github/xigua222/photoo.json","fetched_at":"2026-09-03T03:07:31+00:00"}